(6988399, 1055656, 68769, '<td valign="top">I commented on a Deb photo similar to this a few days back, this has the same dreamy feel. Not really asleep, not quite awake, it''s that perfect spot in between that is so hard to find. Thank You</td>', 'I commented on a Deb photo similar to this a few days back, this has the same dreamy feel. Not really asleep, not quite awake, it''s that perfect spot in between that is so hard to find. Thank You', '2013-03-01 02:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
