(6988573, 1055673, 158576, '<td valign="top">I think this is an instance where having the center group of railings in the center of the photo would have given the lines and geometric shapes more impact.</td>', 'I think this is an instance where having the center group of railings in the center of the photo would have given the lines and geometric shapes more impact.', '2013-03-01 08:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
