(6988811, 1055198, 108580, '<td valign="top">The essence of art is in the portrayal of, and seeing of beauty, the different, the new, the appealing. This achieves that on many levels even if it is not characteristic to DPC ribboners.</td>', 'The essence of art is in the portrayal of, and seeing of beauty, the different, the new, the appealing. This achieves that on many levels even if it is not characteristic to DPC ribboners.', '2013-03-01 12:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6988814, 1055341, 108580, '<td valign="top">A multitude of technicals bring this image into one short shutter opening and closing, yet allows us to methodically dissect that moment in our own time. People in the water, the pollution, the dramatic sky, the lens flare and sun, the ghost forms (Egrets?) around the yellow boat at right, the container vessel with no apparent harbour and then lastly another two white birds appear on the messy shoreline. It''s a complex photo and you can just let it be or let it linger.</td>', 'A multitude of technicals bring this image into one short shutter opening and closing, yet allows us to methodically dissect that moment in our own time. People in the water, the pollution, the dramatic sky, the lens flare and sun, the ghost forms (Egrets?) around the yellow boat at right, the container vessel with no apparent harbour and then lastly another two white birds appear on the messy shoreline. It''s a complex photo and you can just let it be or let it linger.', '2013-03-01 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
