(6989414, 1055489, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC. Lovely. The gritty PP, lead in lines, dramatic sky thanks B&amp;W, the ROT put this in the Art Class. What is I believe lost on a lot of DPC voters especially in this challenge will be the lack of forethought as to the meaning of Art; eg: The lengthy process some painters had to go through to be able to paint like this, never mind as a photographer to re-create this particular effect. Bumped to 8.</td>', 'DMC. Lovely. The gritty PP, lead in lines, dramatic sky thanks B&W, the ROT put this in the Art Class. What is I believe lost on a lot of DPC voters especially in this challenge will be the lack of forethought as to the meaning of Art; eg: The lengthy process some painters had to go through to be able to paint like this, never mind as a photographer to re-create this particular effect. Bumped to 8.', '2013-03-02 11:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
