(6992394, 1055921, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s intriguing -- but it''s almost like it''s missing something. I love the thingy on the left, and the bright spot towards the center. I''m wondering what they would look like just playing with each other without everything else...<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'It''s intriguing -- but it''s almost like it''s missing something. I love the thingy on the left, and the bright spot towards the center. I''m wondering what they would look like just playing with each other without everything else... 6', '2013-03-05 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
