(6993300, 1055530, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like the color, but I''m not able to make any logical sense of the tree branch that disappears under the doors (windows), comes up on the other side, &amp; goes toward the sky. The light has no logic to it either, for me. I hope you will put in some notes to help me understand.</td>', 'I like the color, but I''m not able to make any logical sense of the tree branch that disappears under the doors (windows), comes up on the other side, & goes toward the sky. The light has no logic to it either, for me. I hope you will put in some notes to help me understand.', '2013-03-06 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993317, 1055961, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>I like the tilt of the head and the faraway look with the touch of a smile as she looks out the train window. She is traveling to some destination and the audience is left wondering just what she may be thinking with that smile of fond rememberence of what has past or expectation of what is to come. Her style of dress recalls the days of the 1930''s or 1940''s. I think the play of soft light from the window really complements the model and adds to that nostalgic mood of ''daydreaming''.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment I like the tilt of the head and the faraway look with the touch of a smile as she looks out the train window. She is traveling to some destination and the audience is left wondering just what she may be thinking with that smile of fond rememberence of what has past or expectation of what is to come. Her style of dress recalls the days of the 1930''s or 1940''s. I think the play of soft light from the window really complements the model and adds to that nostalgic mood of ''daydreaming''.', '2013-03-06 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
