(6993687, 1055040, 49954, '<td valign="top">Definitely art here... makes me keep looking.   A real person?  A statue?  Eeerily done.  Nice.</td>', 'Definitely art here... makes me keep looking.   A real person?  A statue?  Eeerily done.  Nice.', '2013-03-07 11:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993688, 1054660, 49954, '<td valign="top">A bit too abstract for my taste, with too much black (negative space) between the interesting parts.</td>', 'A bit too abstract for my taste, with too much black (negative space) between the interesting parts.', '2013-03-07 11:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993689, 1055805, 49954, '<td valign="top">This would probably work better on a larger scale than the site provides.  Hard to capture in the stairwell and clearly make out the makeout session.  But I still like it and it makes m e look harder... especially the reflection (?) of the  woman on the left.</td>', 'This would probably work better on a larger scale than the site provides.  Hard to capture in the stairwell and clearly make out the makeout session.  But I still like it and it makes m e look harder... especially the reflection (?) of the  woman on the left.', '2013-03-07 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993690, 1054593, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!</td>', 'Nice colors!', '2013-03-07 11:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993691, 1055647, 49954, '<td valign="top">Awesome tones and cloud formatins...  very nice.  The softness on the right is a bit distracting to me...</td>', 'Awesome tones and cloud formatins...  very nice.  The softness on the right is a bit distracting to me...', '2013-03-07 11:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993692, 1055668, 49954, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s a tree shadow, but it looks like a person''s legs... which adds a sinister element considering what barbers used to do (or in mafia movies too).  Anyway, nicely done.</td>', 'I''m sure it''s a tree shadow, but it looks like a person''s legs... which adds a sinister element considering what barbers used to do (or in mafia movies too).  Anyway, nicely done.', '2013-03-07 11:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993693, 1054932, 49954, '<td valign="top">Interesting... the framing of the upper cloud does not do much for me personally and distracts a bit... but you''re the artist, so you would have your reasons.  Also the overgrowth in the bottom area, especially where it eclipses the pond breaks my eye.  I personally think a crop of pond to bright clouds with the lovely lone tree as the point of focus would be a better composition.  Criticism aside, it got me to look this long to point out my perceived flaws, so it''s definitely appealing  at its base level.  Nice colors and contrasts in the "stripes" (dark pond, light ground, dark treeline, bright sky)</td>', 'Interesting... the framing of the upper cloud does not do much for me personally and distracts a bit... but you''re the artist, so you would have your reasons.  Also the overgrowth in the bottom area, especially where it eclipses the pond breaks my eye.  I personally think a crop of pond to bright clouds with the lovely lone tree as the point of focus would be a better composition.  Criticism aside, it got me to look this long to point out my perceived flaws, so it''s definitely appealing  at its base level.  Nice colors and contrasts in the "stripes" (dark pond, light ground, dark treeline, bright sky)', '2013-03-07 11:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993694, 1055240, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice vintage cars there... probably the latest models in Cuba :)</td>', 'Nice vintage cars there... probably the latest models in Cuba :)', '2013-03-07 11:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993695, 1054702, 49954, '<td valign="top">There''s some art!  Nice work...  Excellent still life.</td>', 'There''s some art!  Nice work...  Excellent still life.', '2013-03-07 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993696, 1054967, 49954, '<td valign="top">Incoming!  Nice fortunate angle... lovely color.</td>', 'Incoming!  Nice fortunate angle... lovely color.', '2013-03-07 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993697, 1054695, 49954, '<td valign="top">Lovely framing and expression.</td>', 'Lovely framing and expression.', '2013-03-07 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993698, 1054476, 49954, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tad better in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Perhaps a tad better in B&W?', '2013-03-07 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
