(6993890, 1055767, 103142, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite get past this one. Part of me thinks it''s just flat and two dimensional picture of a dead thing, and then I look again and it looks almost marble-like and just a bit too perfect to be just a dead thing and there''s something so artistic about it.<br/> <br/>It''s the legs and the head that does it. The curl of the bottom foot, and the placement of the back foot.<br/> <br/>Yup -- I guess it really is art. -8-<br/> <br/>:D</td>', 'I can''t quite get past this one. Part of me thinks it''s just flat and two dimensional picture of a dead thing, and then I look again and it looks almost marble-like and just a bit too perfect to be just a dead thing and there''s something so artistic about it. It''s the legs and the head that does it. The curl of the bottom foot, and the placement of the back foot. Yup -- I guess it really is art. -8- :D', '2013-03-07 14:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993891, 1055650, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is one where the title really helps. It''s lovely. Quite nice. But I was ready to move on. Yet the title moved it up almost a point and a 1/2. It gave it the warmth and the feeling that was there on the edge, but just hadn''t made it through yet. -8-</td>', 'This is one where the title really helps. It''s lovely. Quite nice. But I was ready to move on. Yet the title moved it up almost a point and a 1/2. It gave it the warmth and the feeling that was there on the edge, but just hadn''t made it through yet. -8-', '2013-03-07 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6993892, 1055489, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m so torn on this one. Part of me really doesn''t like the heavy processing. But then it grows on you quite a bit. But then it''s so heavily processed... <br/> <br/>So I''ve come to the conclusion that I love the processing on the church itself and in the fields. And the cloud in the upper left is quite nice. But the clouds in the middle are a bit heavy handed, because they become the focal point of an absolutely gorgeous piece of work.<br/> <br/>This is not something that I would have thought I''d consider art -- the landscapes aren''t really calling to me. But I''m really liking this. -8-</td>', 'I''m so torn on this one. Part of me really doesn''t like the heavy processing. But then it grows on you quite a bit. But then it''s so heavily processed...  So I''ve come to the conclusion that I love the processing on the church itself and in the fields. And the cloud in the upper left is quite nice. But the clouds in the middle are a bit heavy handed, because they become the focal point of an absolutely gorgeous piece of work. This is not something that I would have thought I''d consider art -- the landscapes aren''t really calling to me. But I''m really liking this. -8-', '2013-03-07 14:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
