(6994327, 1055266, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is so incredibly beautiful, the ripple the composition, the POV, and what an amazing looking dog to boot. I love the gorgeous bluey water, this is one of my top picks, all the best!<br/> <br/>So totally adorable I keep coming back, it deserves one of these for sure and a fave <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is so incredibly beautiful, the ripple the composition, the POV, and what an amazing looking dog to boot. I love the gorgeous bluey water, this is one of my top picks, all the best! So totally adorable I keep coming back, it deserves one of these for sure and a fave ', '2013-03-07 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6994329, 1055838, 119419, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, moody, urban, the grain of a cultured film buff along with bubbles and water droplets. I can imagine you pressing the shutter with one hand and a glass of Chateau Margaux Bordeaux in the other, you decadent bohemian you! An 8 for your sins ;)</td>', 'Beautifully done, moody, urban, the grain of a cultured film buff along with bubbles and water droplets. I can imagine you pressing the shutter with one hand and a glass of Chateau Margaux Bordeaux in the other, you decadent bohemian you! An 8 for your sins ;)', '2013-03-07 21:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6994334, 1055656, 119419, '<td valign="top">Whispers on a windswept dream scape gives the one a transcendentalist experience of being drawn into the belly of the sea, surrendering oneself uninhibitedly to the dark depths of your imaginings. Well done. 8</td>', 'Whispers on a windswept dream scape gives the one a transcendentalist experience of being drawn into the belly of the sea, surrendering oneself uninhibitedly to the dark depths of your imaginings. Well done. 8', '2013-03-07 21:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6994336, 1055433, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nothing like a sharp dressed man pull a bird or two. Jagarishly clever overtones gives me more to think about than birdseed, and an optimistic romantic with plumage on offer will prove the damsels are well to be wary of this mans'' intentions. An 8 for your hungry birds and their gigolo ;)</td>', 'Nothing like a sharp dressed man pull a bird or two. Jagarishly clever overtones gives me more to think about than birdseed, and an optimistic romantic with plumage on offer will prove the damsels are well to be wary of this mans'' intentions. An 8 for your hungry birds and their gigolo ;)', '2013-03-07 21:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6994337, 1054948, 119419, '<td valign="top">The sweetness of devotion and a wry smile renders me a bubbling puddle of admiration and longing. It happens in a moment but lasts beyond a lifetime. 8</td>', 'The sweetness of devotion and a wry smile renders me a bubbling puddle of admiration and longing. It happens in a moment but lasts beyond a lifetime. 8', '2013-03-07 21:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6994344, 1054432, 114285, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo, which could of really been enhanced with some better PP skills, wish this was in black and white, but that''s just me, the sky looks a bit blown out, but that''s minor, what a great moment, top ten for me!<br/> <br/>Despite the tiny flaws I still love this and keep coming back to it, the timing is amazing, this is much more than a photo of a person diving! You receive my verineat, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1070026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg"/></a> only two given out in this challenge well done, and all the best ;o)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-13 23:46:24.</i></td>', 'Incredible photo, which could of really been enhanced with some better PP skills, wish this was in black and white, but that''s just me, the sky looks a bit blown out, but that''s minor, what a great moment, top ten for me! Despite the tiny flaws I still love this and keep coming back to it, the timing is amazing, this is much more than a photo of a person diving! You receive my verineat,  only two given out in this challenge well done, and all the best ;o)', '2013-03-07 21:36:48.000000', '2014-02-13 23:46:24.000000', 1),
