(6994388, 1055909, 119419, '<td valign="top">The indignation, curiosity and menace of a feline forced into an unlikely symbiosis with an inanimate elephas maximus indicus conjours a wonderful mix of practicality and absurdity. Veiled in the junctured frame of your world and theirs adds to the artistry and embellished visual narrative created. Congrats and thank you for the show 8</td>', 'The indignation, curiosity and menace of a feline forced into an unlikely symbiosis with an inanimate elephas maximus indicus conjours a wonderful mix of practicality and absurdity. Veiled in the junctured frame of your world and theirs adds to the artistry and embellished visual narrative created. Congrats and thank you for the show 8', '2013-03-07 21:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
