(6994936, 1055986, 108580, '<td valign="top">the 4, 3, 2, 1 voters have spent too much time in front of Sesame Street and not enough time at the <a href="//www.tate.org.uk/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tate</a>. Whilst not entirely my cup of tea I gave it an enjoyable 6.</td>', 'the 4, 3, 2, 1 voters have spent too much time in front of Sesame Street and not enough time at the Tate. Whilst not entirely my cup of tea I gave it an enjoyable 6.', '2013-03-08 01:55:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6994938, 1055225, 137576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HarveyG:</b></div><hr/><i> She''s going to get a lot more views post rollover than the top10 :) 7. Beautiful. What on Earth did you do to her to become an ex? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Was my choice, but it''s a long story met her 3 weeks after my long term relationship with my lads mum had gone south on account of her going off with another fella, met Vicki she fell hard and fast for me I couldn''t have my heart Brocken again do fast so pushed her away. We stayed friends so alls well :)</td>', 'Originally posted by HarveyG: She''s going to get a lot more views post rollover than the top10 :) 7. Beautiful. What on Earth did you do to her to become an ex?   Was my choice, but it''s a long story met her 3 weeks after my long term relationship with my lads mum had gone south on account of her going off with another fella, met Vicki she fell hard and fast for me I couldn''t have my heart Brocken again do fast so pushed her away. We stayed friends so alls well :)', '2013-03-08 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6994940, 1055225, 137576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HarveyG:</b></div><hr/><i> She''s going to get a lot more views post rollover than the top10 :) 7. Beautiful. What on Earth did you do to her to become an ex? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Was my choice, but it''s a long story met her 3 weeks after my long term relationship with my lads mum had gone south on account of her going off with another fella, met Vicki she fell hard and fast for me I couldn''t have my heart broken again,  so pushed her away. We stayed friends so alls well :) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: Originally posted by HarveyG: She''s going to get a lot more views post rollover than the top10 :) 7. Beautiful. What on Earth did you do to her to become an ex?   Was my choice, but it''s a long story met her 3 weeks after my long term relationship with my lads mum had gone south on account of her going off with another fella, met Vicki she fell hard and fast for me I couldn''t have my heart broken again,  so pushed her away. We stayed friends so alls well :) ', '2013-03-08 01:56:57.000000', NULL, 0),
