(6995003, 1055800, 113591, '<td valign="top">Really a buggy? Goodness.<br/> <br/>So Art got you onto your knees eh?<br/> <br/>Quite interesting, the cantilevered angle makes it so. <br/>As always, [to your arty side''s detriment], pin-sharp, and all in focus.<br/> <br/>I do like the colour treatment. <br/> <br/>This is pop-art if I''m not mistaken, and a very good example. Perfect for a 1980''s music album cover.<br/></td>', 'Really a buggy? Goodness. So Art got you onto your knees eh? Quite interesting, the cantilevered angle makes it so. As always, [to your arty side''s detriment], pin-sharp, and all in focus. I do like the colour treatment.  This is pop-art if I''m not mistaken, and a very good example. Perfect for a 1980''s music album cover.', '2013-03-08 03:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
