(6995719, 1054432, 136235, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m in awe that this is a selfie!!!  What dedication. How many dives did it take? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To be honest I wanted to swim anyway so I just set up the shot and then started diving off like I normally would have :) I probably did 20 or so dives to get one that was straight enough.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: I''m in awe that this is a selfie!!!  What dedication. How many dives did it take?   To be honest I wanted to swim anyway so I just set up the shot and then started diving off like I normally would have :) I probably did 20 or so dives to get one that was straight enough.', '2013-03-09 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
