(6999210, 1054984, 124190, '<td valign="top">This is the photo that will inspire us all.    I did not submit, look at or vote in the Art challenge for some reason.   Now I know why.  Because, for that very unknown reason my choices led me here......right here right now.    Looking at this wonderful photograph.   I hope you get to see how much we all are appreciating your share in this......   we are all on the journey.........together.   Closing eyes we all look and sense the connections........    My free study for February was disqualified because I am not a stickler for rules.....I mess up.... a lot......some details seem more important to others...and I pay the price....oh well.    But YOUR comment was the one that stays deeply in my heart.   And I have gone back to read it many times.  And you are the one who wrote it with the most sensitive and observant feelings and words.   Thank you....it is YOU!!!!!!!    :-)</td>', 'This is the photo that will inspire us all.    I did not submit, look at or vote in the Art challenge for some reason.   Now I know why.  Because, for that very unknown reason my choices led me here......right here right now.    Looking at this wonderful photograph.   I hope you get to see how much we all are appreciating your share in this......   we are all on the journey.........together.   Closing eyes we all look and sense the connections........    My free study for February was disqualified because I am not a stickler for rules.....I mess up.... a lot......some details seem more important to others...and I pay the price....oh well.    But YOUR comment was the one that stays deeply in my heart.   And I have gone back to read it many times.  And you are the one who wrote it with the most sensitive and observant feelings and words.   Thank you....it is YOU!!!!!!!    :-)', '2013-03-13 16:31:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6999319, 1055726, 19825, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i>Not quite a tiny violin. What do you call that?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I would call it an excellent image.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Paul:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this an 8. In retrospect I was a bit stingy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I think Paul is agreeing with me.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia:Not quite a tiny violin. What do you call that? I would call it an excellent image. Originally posted by Paul: I gave this an 8. In retrospect I was a bit stingy.  I think Paul is agreeing with me.', '2013-03-13 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
